    "en": {
      "text": "<stasis/>Stasis Shards now grant <stasis/>Frost Armor upon pickup:\n• Small Stasis Shards grant x1 <stasis/>Frost Armor, 10% Melee Ability Energy, and restore 10 HP.\n• Large Stasis Shards grant x3 <stasis/>Frost Armor, 50% Melee Ability Energy, and restore 20 HP.\n\nWhile <stasis/>Frost Armor is active: \n• <kinetic/>Kinetic and <stasis/>Stasis Weapon Kills have an escalating chance to trigger a <stasis/>Stasis Shatter based on the number of <stasis/>Frost Armor stacks.\n• Taking damage grants ?% Melee Ability energy (once per second).\n\n<bold Intrinsic to All Stasis Subclasses: />\nStasis Shards are generated by:\n• Shattering a <stasis/>Frozen target or <stasis/>Stasis Crystal\n• Defeating a <stasis/>Stasis-Debuffed (Slowed or Frozen) target\n\nMinor combatants generate a small <stasis/>Stasis Crystal, while Elites, Minibosses, and Guardians generate a Large <stasis/>Stasis Crystal.\n\n<bold/><pvp In PvP Only: /> \nStasis Shards go on a 10 second cooldown upon creating 6 shards within ? seconds of the first.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-26T05:49:00.095Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
